 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・品種: 盛夏〜晩夏に刈り込み、乱れた茎葉を除いて秋の返り咲きを促す（'Zagreb' と同じ扱い）。MBG の「somewhat aggressively」は種の株の話で、品種は不稔、Gaißmayer は「ランナーは決して厄介にならない」ので E にしない。機械の B から変更",
  "management_type_quote": "Plants may be sheared in mid to late summer to promote a fall rebloom and to remove any sprawling or unkempt foliage.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": "強",
  "muggy_west_only": "強",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/品種] Tolerant of heat, humidity and drought.\n[Walters/品種] Tolerant of hot, dry sites, once established.\n[Walters/品種] Tolerates heat and humidity.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or South-facing or North-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 2／NC State・品種] the plant can spread by rhizomes（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 0／NC State・品種] The seeds are sterile（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 0／NC State・品種] The seeds are sterile but the plant can spread by rhizomes.\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] MBG は 1 相当\n[地下茎 2／NC State・品種] The seeds are sterile but the plant can spread by rhizomes.\n[地下茎の食い違い] MBG は 1 相当\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち、ランナー）",
